## Project Overview

This project demonstrates a **Phone Number OSINT investigation using PhoneInfoga**.

The purpose of the investigation is to examine what publicly available information can potentially be discovered from a phone number using OSINT techniques.

The investigation focuses on:

* Phone number identification and normalization
* Country identification
* Social media searches
* Disposable SMS provider searches
* Reputation and spam-related searches
* Individual-related searches
* General web searches
* Publicly indexed document searches
* Analysis of tool limitations
* Manual verification of OSINT findings

