## Tool Used

### PhoneInfoga

PhoneInfoga was used as the primary tool for the initial phone-number OSINT scan.

The command used was:

```bash
./phoneinfoga scan -n +923273378369
```

The tool generated multiple search queries that can be used for further manual OSINT investigation.

